# Google Play app identity for fastlane/supply.
#
# Credentials are NOT configured here. Supply resolves them in this order:
#   1. PLAY_JSON_KEY env var containing the raw service-account JSON
#      (preferred for CI — nothing touches disk)
#   2. fastlane/play-service-account.json on disk (gitignored)
#
# See the Fastfile for the lanes that use this.

